## Symptom

A broker root deleted or made unwritable mid-service crashes the machine connector with an unhandled Sys_error: machine_root_sync_is_noop tolerates a missing dir, but the noop branch write_connector_state (c2c_relay_connector.ml:3549) and write_connector_state_error (3598) do bare open_out on a tmp path under the root. discover_machine_broker_roots always conses the primary, so a deleted PRIMARY repo dir is a permanent crash loop at every pass until operator action.

## Fix direction

Pre-check existence/writability (or catch Sys_error) at the state-writer call sites and skip the root with a left-discovery log line.

## Evidence

Connector review 2026-09-17.